 "remarks": "This bright and nicely updated top-floor condo at Mallards Landing offers 1,196 sq. ft. of comfortable one-level living with two bedrooms and two full baths on the Norwalk/Darien border. The open living and dining areas are filled with natural light and feature soaring vaulted ceilings. The spacious living room includes a skylight, wood-burning fireplace and plenty of room for a home-office space. Two sets of sliding glass doors open to a large private deck overlooking the pool-an inviting place for outdoor dining or relaxing. The updated kitchen features granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, abundant cabinetry, recessed lighting and a breakfast bar with seating. Both bedrooms are spacious with ample closet space, and the primary includes a private ensuite bath with a jetted tub. Additional conveniences include a full-size in-unit washer and dryer, keyless entry, smart thermostats, attic storage and bike storage. Two reserved parking spaces-one covered carport and one assigned space-are included, along with community pool access. Conveniently located less than one mile from I-95 and less than two miles from the Darien and Rowayton train stations, with easy access to Route 1, SoNo, shopping, dining and fitness. Available 11/10/26.",
